[I] Enhanced Programmable ircII Client, version 5

[T] EPIC5 (Enhanced Programmable ircII Client) is a text mode IRC client
[T] descended from ircII. It is highly scriptable and supports Perl, Ruby,
[T] Python and TCL besides its own ircII script language.

[U] https://epicsol.org/

